  "description": "NaCoO₂ is H-Phase structured and crystallizes in the hexagonal P6₃/mmc space group. Na¹⁺ is bonded in a 6-coordinate geometry to six equivalent O²⁻ atoms. All Na-O bond lengths are 2.31 Å. Co³⁺ is bonded to six equivalent O²⁻ atoms to form edge-sharing CoO₆ octahedra. All Co-O bond lengths are 1.93 Å. O²⁻ is bonded to three equivalent Na¹⁺ and three equivalent Co³⁺ atoms to form a mixture of corner, edge, and face-sharing ONa₃Co₃ octahedra. The corner-sharing octahedral tilt angles range from 0-42°.",
